  "body": "Residual of #4925 — the orphan-cleanup half landed in #4917's enqueue-failure compensation (`server.ts:237`); this lands the missing minimum spec gate. PR #4948 carried it but is stale and conflicting.\n\n**Change:** `parseSessionRequest` now rejects, with a `ValidationError` (mapped to 400), a session request that has **no explicit title** and whose prompt is shorter than `MIN_PROMPT_SPEC_CHARS` (40). The error names the missing spec: `prompt: too short to name any work (N < 40 chars) and no title given — describe the work in the prompt or pass an explicit title`.\n\n- The gate runs **after** every other field validation, so existing per-field errors keep precedence (an invalid `priority`/`directory` still fails as that field).\n- An **explicit title exempts** the request — the caller named the work.\n- `MIN_PROMPT_SPEC_CHARS = 40` is exported (the PR #4948 value) so callers and tests share one constant.\n\n**Tests** (`bun test test/validate.test.ts test/server.test.ts` — 54 pass, 0 fail):\n\n- a titleless short prompt is rejected and the error names the missing spec;\n- a prompt at the floor with no title passes; an explicit title exempts a short prompt;\n- the gate runs last (an invalid priority still errors as `priority`);\n- existing fixtures updated to compliant prompts (the blank-title/directory tests of #2664 and the `server.test.ts` base).\n\nCloses #4925.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796725065&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7633&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7633&signature=ba2414c1a0ebae785fc4dc90868c440ffccc3fbd8ce1a0506f08e8e412ea6b57\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7633?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
